       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CLMSUM.
      ******************************************************************
      *  CLMSUM - Claim Summary Display Screen
      *  Workers' Compensation TPA System
      *  HPE NonStop SCREEN COBOL
      *
      *  Displays comprehensive claim summary with:
      *    - Claim header (claim#, claimant, employer, DOI)
      *    - Financial summary (reserves, payments, recoveries)
      *    - Status and key dates
      *    - Recent diary entries (scrollable)
      *    - Quick note entry line
      *
      *  Function Keys:
      *    F1=Help  F2=Reserves  F3=Exit  F4=Payments
      *    F5=Diary  F6=Notes  F7=Medical  F8=Scroll Down
      *    F9=Scroll Up  F16=Refresh
      *
      *  Pathway SCREEN server, retrieves data via PATHSEND
      *  from CLMSETUP, CLMDIARY, and financial servers.
      ******************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER. TANDEM.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER. TANDEM.

       DATA DIVISION.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

       01  WS-CONTROL-FIELDS.
           05  WS-FUNCTION-KEY     PIC 99.
           05  WS-EXIT-FLAG        PIC X       VALUE 'N'.
               88  WS-EXIT-NOW           VALUE 'Y'.
           05  WS-REFRESH-FLAG     PIC X       VALUE 'Y'.
               88  WS-NEEDS-REFRESH      VALUE 'Y'.
           05  WS-DIARY-SCROLL-POS PIC 9(4)    VALUE 1.
           05  WS-DIARY-TOTAL      PIC 9(4)    VALUE 0.
           05  WS-DIARY-PAGE-SIZE  PIC 9       VALUE 5.

       01  WS-CLAIM-SEARCH.
           05  WS-SEARCH-CLAIM-NUM PIC X(15).

       01  WS-MESSAGE-LINE         PIC X(78)   VALUE SPACES.

      * Claim header data retrieved from claim master
       01  WS-CLAIM-HEADER.
           05  WS-CH-CLAIM-NUMBER  PIC X(15).
           05  WS-CH-CLAIM-STATUS  PIC X(10).
           05  WS-CH-CLAIM-TYPE    PIC X(15).
           05  WS-CH-CLAIMANT-NAME PIC X(40).
           05  WS-CH-EMPLOYER-NAME PIC X(40).
           05  WS-CH-DOI           PIC X(8).
           05  WS-CH-DOI-DISPLAY   PIC X(10).
           05  WS-CH-JURISDICTION  PIC X(2).
           05  WS-CH-ADJUSTER-ID   PIC X(8).
           05  WS-CH-ADJUSTER-NAME PIC X(30).
           05  WS-CH-COMPENSABILITY PIC X(12).
           05  WS-CH-LITIG-STATUS  PIC X(15).
           05  WS-CH-DATE-CREATED  PIC X(10).
           05  WS-CH-DATE-CLOSED   PIC X(10).

      * Financial summary
       01  WS-FINANCIAL-SUMMARY.
           05  WS-FIN-MED-RESERVE  PIC $$$,$$$,$$9.99.
           05  WS-FIN-IND-RESERVE  PIC $$$,$$$,$$9.99.
           05  WS-FIN-EXP-RESERVE  PIC $$$,$$$,$$9.99.
           05  WS-FIN-TOT-RESERVE  PIC $$$,$$$,$$9.99.
           05  WS-FIN-MED-PAID     PIC $$$,$$$,$$9.99.
           05  WS-FIN-IND-PAID     PIC $$$,$$$,$$9.99.
           05  WS-FIN-EXP-PAID     PIC $$$,$$$,$$9.99.
           05  WS-FIN-TOT-PAID     PIC $$$,$$$,$$9.99.
           05  WS-FIN-RECOVERY     PIC $$$,$$$,$$9.99.
           05  WS-FIN-NET-INCURRED PIC $$$,$$$,$$9.99.

      * Raw financial amounts for calculation
       01  WS-FIN-RAW.
           05  WS-RAW-MED-RSV     PIC S9(9)V99.
           05  WS-RAW-IND-RSV     PIC S9(9)V99.
           05  WS-RAW-EXP-RSV     PIC S9(9)V99.
           05  WS-RAW-TOT-RSV     PIC S9(11)V99.
           05  WS-RAW-MED-PAID    PIC S9(9)V99.
           05  WS-RAW-IND-PAID    PIC S9(9)V99.
           05  WS-RAW-EXP-PAID    PIC S9(9)V99.
           05  WS-RAW-TOT-PAID    PIC S9(11)V99.
           05  WS-RAW-RECOVERY    PIC S9(9)V99.
           05  WS-RAW-NET-INC     PIC S9(11)V99.

      * Diary entries for scrollable display (5 visible at a time)
       01  WS-DIARY-DISPLAY.
           05  WS-DIARY-LINE OCCURS 5 TIMES.
               10  WS-DL-DUE-DATE  PIC X(10).
               10  WS-DL-PRIORITY  PIC X(4).
               10  WS-DL-TYPE      PIC X(10).
               10  WS-DL-SUBJECT   PIC X(45).
               10  WS-DL-STATUS    PIC X(8).

      * Note entry line
       01  WS-NOTE-ENTRY.
           05  WS-NOTE-TEXT        PIC X(76).

      * Key dates display
       01  WS-KEY-DATES.
           05  WS-KD-DOI           PIC X(10).
           05  WS-KD-REPORTED      PIC X(10).
           05  WS-KD-CREATED       PIC X(10).
           05  WS-KD-LAST-ACTIVITY PIC X(10).
           05  WS-KD-NEXT-REVIEW   PIC X(10).
           05  WS-KD-CLOSED        PIC X(10).

      * PATHSEND fields
       01  WS-PS-FIELDS.
           05  WS-PS-CLM-SERVER    PIC X(16)
                                   VALUE "$CLMS           ".
           05  WS-PS-DIARY-SERVER  PIC X(16)
                                   VALUE "$DIARY          ".
           05  WS-PS-FIN-SERVER    PIC X(16)
                                   VALUE "$FINSRV         ".
           05  WS-PS-TIMEOUT       PIC S9(9) COMP VALUE 3000.
           05  WS-PS-ERROR         PIC S9(4) COMP.
           05  WS-PS-REPLY-LEN     PIC S9(4) COMP.

       SCREEN SECTION.

      ******************************************************************
      *  SCREEN: CLAIM-SUMMARY-HEADER
      ******************************************************************
       01  CLAIM-SUMMARY-HDR.
           05  BLANK SCREEN.
           05  LINE 01 COL 01 VALUE
               "MAINFRAME-MOD  WORKERS' COMP TPA".
           05  LINE 01 COL 45 VALUE "CLAIM SUMMARY".
           05  LINE 02 COL 01 VALUE ALL "=".

      ******************************************************************
      *  SCREEN: CLAIM-HEADER-SECTION
      ******************************************************************
       01  CLAIM-HEADER-DISPLAY.
           05  LINE 03 COL 02 VALUE "Claim#:".
           05  LINE 03 COL 10
               FROM WS-CH-CLAIM-NUMBER.
           05  LINE 03 COL 28 VALUE "Status:".
           05  LINE 03 COL 36
               FROM WS-CH-CLAIM-STATUS.
           05  LINE 03 COL 50 VALUE "Type:".
           05  LINE 03 COL 56
               FROM WS-CH-CLAIM-TYPE.
           05  LINE 04 COL 02 VALUE "Claimant:".
           05  LINE 04 COL 12
               FROM WS-CH-CLAIMANT-NAME.
           05  LINE 04 COL 55 VALUE "DOI:".
           05  LINE 04 COL 60
               FROM WS-CH-DOI-DISPLAY.
           05  LINE 05 COL 02 VALUE "Employer:".
           05  LINE 05 COL 12
               FROM WS-CH-EMPLOYER-NAME.
           05  LINE 06 COL 02 VALUE "Adjuster:".
           05  LINE 06 COL 12
               FROM WS-CH-ADJUSTER-NAME.
           05  LINE 06 COL 45 VALUE "Juris:".
           05  LINE 06 COL 52
               FROM WS-CH-JURISDICTION.
           05  LINE 06 COL 58 VALUE "Comp:".
           05  LINE 06 COL 64
               FROM WS-CH-COMPENSABILITY.
           05  LINE 07 COL 02 VALUE ALL "-".

      ******************************************************************
      *  SCREEN: FINANCIAL-SECTION
      ******************************************************************
       01  FINANCIAL-DISPLAY.
           05  LINE 08 COL 02 VALUE "FINANCIAL SUMMARY".
           05  LINE 08 COL 28 VALUE "Reserves".
           05  LINE 08 COL 46 VALUE "Paid".
           05  LINE 09 COL 04 VALUE "Medical:".
           05  LINE 09 COL 18
               FROM WS-FIN-MED-RESERVE.
           05  LINE 09 COL 36
               FROM WS-FIN-MED-PAID.
           05  LINE 10 COL 04 VALUE "Indemnity:".
           05  LINE 10 COL 18
               FROM WS-FIN-IND-RESERVE.
           05  LINE 10 COL 36
               FROM WS-FIN-IND-PAID.
           05  LINE 11 COL 04 VALUE "Expense:".
           05  LINE 11 COL 18
               FROM WS-FIN-EXP-RESERVE.
           05  LINE 11 COL 36
               FROM WS-FIN-EXP-PAID.
           05  LINE 12 COL 04 VALUE "TOTAL:".
           05  LINE 12 COL 18
               FROM WS-FIN-TOT-RESERVE.
           05  LINE 12 COL 36
               FROM WS-FIN-TOT-PAID.
           05  LINE 12 COL 54 VALUE "Recovery:".
           05  LINE 12 COL 64
               FROM WS-FIN-RECOVERY.
           05  LINE 13 COL 04 VALUE "NET INCURRED:".
           05  LINE 13 COL 18
               FROM WS-FIN-NET-INCURRED.
           05  LINE 13 COL 40 VALUE "Litigation:".
           05  LINE 13 COL 52
               FROM WS-CH-LITIG-STATUS.

      ******************************************************************
      *  SCREEN: KEY-DATES-SECTION
      ******************************************************************
       01  KEY-DATES-DISPLAY.
           05  LINE 14 COL 02 VALUE ALL "-".
           05  LINE 15 COL 02 VALUE "KEY DATES".
           05  LINE 15 COL 14 VALUE "Reported:".
           05  LINE 15 COL 24
               FROM WS-KD-REPORTED.
           05  LINE 15 COL 37 VALUE "Created:".
           05  LINE 15 COL 46
               FROM WS-KD-CREATED.
           05  LINE 15 COL 59 VALUE "LastAct:".
           05  LINE 15 COL 68
               FROM WS-KD-LAST-ACTIVITY.

      ******************************************************************
      *  SCREEN: DIARY-SECTION (scrollable)
      ******************************************************************
       01  DIARY-LIST-DISPLAY.
           05  LINE 16 COL 02 VALUE ALL "-".
           05  LINE 17 COL 02 VALUE
               "DIARY  Due Date   Pri  Type       Subject".
           05  LINE 18 COL 02 VALUE " 1)".
           05  LINE 18 COL 06
               FROM WS-DL-DUE-DATE(1).
           05  LINE 18 COL 17
               FROM WS-DL-PRIORITY(1).
           05  LINE 18 COL 22
               FROM WS-DL-TYPE(1).
           05  LINE 18 COL 33
               FROM WS-DL-SUBJECT(1).
           05  LINE 19 COL 02 VALUE " 2)".
           05  LINE 19 COL 06
               FROM WS-DL-DUE-DATE(2).
           05  LINE 19 COL 17
               FROM WS-DL-PRIORITY(2).
           05  LINE 19 COL 22
               FROM WS-DL-TYPE(2).
           05  LINE 19 COL 33
               FROM WS-DL-SUBJECT(2).
           05  LINE 20 COL 02 VALUE " 3)".
           05  LINE 20 COL 06
               FROM WS-DL-DUE-DATE(3).
           05  LINE 20 COL 17
               FROM WS-DL-PRIORITY(3).
           05  LINE 20 COL 22
               FROM WS-DL-TYPE(3).
           05  LINE 20 COL 33
               FROM WS-DL-SUBJECT(3).
           05  LINE 21 COL 02 VALUE " 4)".
           05  LINE 21 COL 06
               FROM WS-DL-DUE-DATE(4).
           05  LINE 21 COL 17
               FROM WS-DL-PRIORITY(4).
           05  LINE 21 COL 22
               FROM WS-DL-TYPE(4).
           05  LINE 21 COL 33
               FROM WS-DL-SUBJECT(4).

      ******************************************************************
      *  SCREEN: NOTE-ENTRY and FOOTER
      ******************************************************************
       01  NOTE-AND-FOOTER.
           05  LINE 22 COL 02 VALUE ALL "-".
           05  LINE 23 COL 02 VALUE "Note:".
           05  LINE 23 COL 08
               USING WS-NOTE-TEXT.
           05  LINE 24 COL 01 VALUE
               "F2=Rsv F3=Exit F4=Pymt F5=Diary F6=Notes"
               & " F7=Med F8=Dn F9=Up".

      ******************************************************************
      *  SCREEN: CLAIM-SEARCH -- Initial claim number entry
      ******************************************************************
       01  CLAIM-SEARCH-SCREEN.
           05  BLANK SCREEN.
           05  LINE 01 COL 01 VALUE
               "MAINFRAME-MOD  WORKERS' COMP TPA".
           05  LINE 01 COL 45 VALUE "CLAIM SUMMARY".
           05  LINE 02 COL 01 VALUE ALL "=".
           05  LINE 10 COL 20 VALUE "Enter Claim Number:".
           05  LINE 10 COL 41
               USING WS-SEARCH-CLAIM-NUM.
           05  LINE 12 COL 20 VALUE
               "Press ENTER to display, F3 to exit".
           05  LINE 20 COL 02
               FROM WS-MESSAGE-LINE.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.

       0000-MAIN-CONTROL.
           PERFORM 1000-INITIALIZE
           PERFORM 1500-GET-CLAIM-NUMBER
           IF NOT WS-EXIT-NOW
               PERFORM 2000-LOAD-CLAIM-DATA
               PERFORM 3000-DISPLAY-LOOP
                   UNTIL WS-EXIT-NOW
           END-IF
           STOP RUN.

       1000-INITIALIZE.
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-MESSAGE-LINE
           MOVE 'N' TO WS-EXIT-FLAG
           MOVE 'Y' TO WS-REFRESH-FLAG
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DIARY-SCROLL-POS
           MOVE 0 TO WS-DIARY-TOTAL.

       1500-GET-CLAIM-NUMBER.
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-SEARCH-CLAIM-NUM
           DISPLAY CLAIM-SEARCH-SCREEN
           ACCEPT CLAIM-SEARCH-SCREEN
           IF WS-FUNCTION-KEY = 3
               SET WS-EXIT-NOW TO TRUE
           ELSE
               IF WS-SEARCH-CLAIM-NUM = SPACES
                   MOVE "Claim number is required"
                       TO WS-MESSAGE-LINE
                   PERFORM 1500-GET-CLAIM-NUMBER
               END-IF
           END-IF.

       2000-LOAD-CLAIM-DATA.
           PERFORM 2100-FETCH-CLAIM-HEADER
           PERFORM 2200-FETCH-FINANCIALS
           PERFORM 2300-FETCH-DIARIES
           PERFORM 2400-FORMAT-DISPLAY-FIELDS.

       2100-FETCH-CLAIM-HEADER.
           CALL "SERVERCLASS_DIALOG_BEGIN_" USING
               WS-PS-CLM-SERVER
               WS-PS-ERROR
           CALL "SERVERCLASS_DIALOG_SEND_" USING
               WS-SEARCH-CLAIM-NUM
               LENGTH OF WS-SEARCH-CLAIM-NUM
               WS-CLAIM-HEADER
               LENGTH OF WS-CLAIM-HEADER
               WS-PS-REPLY-LEN
               WS-PS-TIMEOUT
               WS-PS-ERROR
           CALL "SERVERCLASS_DIALOG_END_" USING
               WS-PS-ERROR.

       2200-FETCH-FINANCIALS.
           CALL "SERVERCLASS_DIALOG_BEGIN_" USING
               WS-PS-FIN-SERVER
               WS-PS-ERROR
           CALL "SERVERCLASS_DIALOG_SEND_" USING
               WS-SEARCH-CLAIM-NUM
               LENGTH OF WS-SEARCH-CLAIM-NUM
               WS-FIN-RAW
               LENGTH OF WS-FIN-RAW
               WS-PS-REPLY-LEN
               WS-PS-TIMEOUT
               WS-PS-ERROR
           CALL "SERVERCLASS_DIALOG_END_" USING
               WS-PS-ERROR.

       2300-FETCH-DIARIES.
           CALL "SERVERCLASS_DIALOG_BEGIN_" USING
               WS-PS-DIARY-SERVER
               WS-PS-ERROR
           CALL "SERVERCLASS_DIALOG_SEND_" USING
               WS-SEARCH-CLAIM-NUM
               LENGTH OF WS-SEARCH-CLAIM-NUM
               WS-DIARY-DISPLAY
               LENGTH OF WS-DIARY-DISPLAY
               WS-PS-REPLY-LEN
               WS-PS-TIMEOUT
               WS-PS-ERROR
           CALL "SERVERCLASS_DIALOG_END_" USING
               WS-PS-ERROR.

       2400-FORMAT-DISPLAY-FIELDS.
      *    Format financial amounts for display
           COMPUTE WS-RAW-TOT-RSV =
               WS-RAW-MED-RSV + WS-RAW-IND-RSV + WS-RAW-EXP-RSV
           COMPUTE WS-RAW-TOT-PAID =
               WS-RAW-MED-PAID + WS-RAW-IND-PAID + WS-RAW-EXP-PAID
           COMPUTE WS-RAW-NET-INC =
               WS-RAW-TOT-RSV + WS-RAW-TOT-PAID - WS-RAW-RECOVERY

           MOVE WS-RAW-MED-RSV  TO WS-FIN-MED-RESERVE
           MOVE WS-RAW-IND-RSV  TO WS-FIN-IND-RESERVE
           MOVE WS-RAW-EXP-RSV  TO WS-FIN-EXP-RESERVE
           MOVE WS-RAW-TOT-RSV  TO WS-FIN-TOT-RESERVE
           MOVE WS-RAW-MED-PAID TO WS-FIN-MED-PAID
           MOVE WS-RAW-IND-PAID TO WS-FIN-IND-PAID
           MOVE WS-RAW-EXP-PAID TO WS-FIN-EXP-PAID
           MOVE WS-RAW-TOT-PAID TO WS-FIN-TOT-PAID
           MOVE WS-RAW-RECOVERY TO WS-FIN-RECOVERY
           MOVE WS-RAW-NET-INC  TO WS-FIN-NET-INCURRED

      *    Format DOI for display (YYYY/MM/DD)
           STRING WS-CH-DOI(1:4) "/" WS-CH-DOI(5:2) "/"
               WS-CH-DOI(7:2) DELIMITED BY SIZE
               INTO WS-CH-DOI-DISPLAY.

       3000-DISPLAY-LOOP.
           IF WS-NEEDS-REFRESH
               PERFORM 3100-REFRESH-SCREEN
               MOVE 'N' TO WS-REFRESH-FLAG
           END-IF
           ACCEPT NOTE-AND-FOOTER
           PERFORM 3200-PROCESS-FUNCTION-KEY.

       3100-REFRESH-SCREEN.
           DISPLAY CLAIM-SUMMARY-HDR
           DISPLAY CLAIM-HEADER-DISPLAY
           DISPLAY FINANCIAL-DISPLAY
           DISPLAY KEY-DATES-DISPLAY
           DISPLAY DIARY-LIST-DISPLAY
           DISPLAY NOTE-AND-FOOTER.

       3200-PROCESS-FUNCTION-KEY.
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-MESSAGE-LINE
           EVALUATE WS-FUNCTION-KEY
               WHEN 2
                   PERFORM 4000-GOTO-RESERVES
               WHEN 3
                   SET WS-EXIT-NOW TO TRUE
               WHEN 4
                   PERFORM 5000-GOTO-PAYMENTS
               WHEN 5
                   PERFORM 6000-GOTO-DIARY
               WHEN 6
                   PERFORM 7000-SAVE-NOTE
               WHEN 7
                   PERFORM 8000-GOTO-MEDICAL
               WHEN 8
                   PERFORM 8100-SCROLL-DOWN
               WHEN 9
                   PERFORM 8200-SCROLL-UP
               WHEN 16
                   PERFORM 2000-LOAD-CLAIM-DATA
                   MOVE 'Y' TO WS-REFRESH-FLAG
               WHEN OTHER
                   MOVE "Use function keys for navigation"
                       TO WS-MESSAGE-LINE
           END-EVALUATE.

       4000-GOTO-RESERVES.
      *    Transfer to Reserve Detail screen (separate program)
           MOVE "Transferring to Reserve Detail..."
               TO WS-MESSAGE-LINE.
      *    SEND CLMRSV USING WS-CH-CLAIM-NUMBER

       5000-GOTO-PAYMENTS.
      *    Transfer to Payment History screen
           MOVE "Transferring to Payment History..."
               TO WS-MESSAGE-LINE.
      *    SEND CLMPYMT USING WS-CH-CLAIM-NUMBER

       6000-GOTO-DIARY.
      *    Transfer to full Diary Management screen
           MOVE "Transferring to Diary Management..."
               TO WS-MESSAGE-LINE.
      *    SEND CLMDSCR USING WS-CH-CLAIM-NUMBER

       7000-SAVE-NOTE.
           IF WS-NOTE-TEXT = SPACES
               MOVE "Enter note text before pressing F6"
                   TO WS-MESSAGE-LINE
           ELSE
      *        Send note to diary server as adjuster note
               MOVE "Note saved successfully"
                   TO WS-MESSAGE-LINE
               MOVE SPACES TO WS-NOTE-TEXT
           END-IF.

       8000-GOTO-MEDICAL.
      *    Transfer to Medical Management screen
           MOVE "Transferring to Medical Management..."
               TO WS-MESSAGE-LINE.
      *    SEND CLMMED USING WS-CH-CLAIM-NUMBER

       8100-SCROLL-DOWN.
           IF WS-DIARY-SCROLL-POS + WS-DIARY-PAGE-SIZE
              < WS-DIARY-TOTAL
               ADD WS-DIARY-PAGE-SIZE TO WS-DIARY-SCROLL-POS
               PERFORM 2300-FETCH-DIARIES
               MOVE 'Y' TO WS-REFRESH-FLAG
           ELSE
               MOVE "End of diary list"
                   TO WS-MESSAGE-LINE
           END-IF.

       8200-SCROLL-UP.
           IF WS-DIARY-SCROLL-POS > 1
               SUBTRACT WS-DIARY-PAGE-SIZE
                   FROM WS-DIARY-SCROLL-POS
               IF WS-DIARY-SCROLL-POS < 1
                   MOVE 1 TO WS-DIARY-SCROLL-POS
               END-IF
               PERFORM 2300-FETCH-DIARIES
               MOVE 'Y' TO WS-REFRESH-FLAG
           ELSE
               MOVE "Already at top of diary list"
                   TO WS-MESSAGE-LINE
           END-IF.
